        "url": "/api/v2/version/22/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "あいてと　おなじ　なきごえを　だす\nことで　なかまと　おもいこませて\nおそわれない　ように　しているのだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "상대와 같은 울음소리를 내서\n동료라고 굳게 믿게 하여\n습격당하지 않도록 하고 있다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il reproduit le cri de ses ennemis pour faire croire\nqu’il est des leurs et éviter d’être attaqué.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es versucht Attacken zu entgehen, indem es den Ruf\ndes Gegners nachahmt und einen Artgenossen mimt.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Imita los sonidos de sus rivales, haciéndoles creer que\nson amigos e impidiendo que le ataquen.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Imita la voce dei nemici per far credere che è dei\nloro, evitando così di essere assalito.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It mimics the cries of other Pokémon to trick them\ninto thinking it’s one of them. This way they won’t\nattack it.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "相手と　同じ　鳴き声を　出す　ことで\n仲間と　思いこませて\n襲われないように　しているのだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Imita los sonidos de sus rivales, haciéndoles creer que\nson amigos e impidiendo que le ataquen.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "ひとの　ことばを　おぼえて　なく。\nなかまが　いっかしょに　あつまると\nみんな　おなじ　ことばを　おぼえる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "사람의 말을 기억해서 운다.\n동료가 한 장소에 모이면\n모두 똑같은 말을 기억한다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "On peut lui enseigner quelques mots. S’il s’agit\nd’un groupe, ils retiendront les mêmes phrases.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es kann die menschliche Sprache nachahmen.\nVersammeln sie sich, bringen sich alle dasselbe bei.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Puede imitar el lenguaje humano. Si se juntan\nvarios, todos aprenden las mismas palabras.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Può imparare il linguaggio umano. Se un gruppo si\nraduna, tutti imparano le stesse parole.",
